#: ui/pages.slint:2540
msgctxt "SettingsPage"
msgid "Watch for leaked passwords every day"
msgstr ""

#: ui/pages.slint:2547
msgctxt "SettingsPage"
msgid ""
"Once a day while the vault is open, every login's password is checked "
"against the newest list of data breaches (Have I Been Pwned). Only the first "
"5 characters of each password's SHA-1 fingerprint leave this computer, never "
"a password. As soon as one turns up in a new breach, the app tells you and "
"Password health shows it. Off until you turn it on, since it uses the "
"network by itself."
msgstr ""

#: ui/pages.slint:2555
msgctxt "SettingsPage"
msgid "Show website icons"
msgstr ""

#: ui/pages.slint:2562
msgctxt "SettingsPage"
msgid ""
"Downloads each site's own icon directly from that site, once, over a secure "
"connection, and keeps it encrypted with your vault. Nothing else is sent. "
"Trade-off: someone watching your network (your provider, a public Wi-Fi) "
"could see which sites were contacted, which hints at where you have "
"accounts. Leave it off for maximum privacy."
msgstr ""

